  "history": [],
  "facts": [
    "The level 1 Builder Hall is broken and has graves, along with several broken buildings surrounding it when it is first encountered in the tutorial. These include: Star Laboratory, Gem Mine, Clock Tower, Battle Machine, Elixir Collector, Gold Mine, Cannon, Army Camp, and Builder Barracks.",
    "During the tutorial, the Builder Hall is upgraded to level 2, and in doing so buildings immediately surrounding apart from the Gem Mine, Clock Tower and Battle Machine are automatically repaired. In addition to this, the Boat is also repaired and the Raged Barbarian is upgraded to level 2.",
